# The functions of Mission_ThreeStooges in level gamblinden (the script levels/gamblinden/scripts/mission_threestooges.py of data03.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script are C (src/game/Script/levels/GamblinDen.c): InitStatus, Init, AfterBrowseNPC, MercenaryASpeech, MercenaryCSpeech, MercenaryBSpeech, SetNextMission.
